		(descr "Omega PCC-SMP-K miniature Type-K thermocouple jack, PC-mount pins. Pad1=TCP(+/chromel) Pad2=TCN(-/alumel), 7.9mm pitch. Per Omega PCC-OST-SMP spec drawing p.2 (miniature/horizontal): dia-1.77mm 4 PLACES = 2 contact holes (7.9 span, round drills) + 2 mounting-bracket NPTH (15.7 span, 6.8mm behind the contact row, retention against plug insertion). Render-review fix 2026-07-23: contact drills were 1.70x0.90 slots (too small for the 1.77 pins) and the bracket holes were MISSING.")
